{"ts":"2026-07-30T13:02:13.292Z","type":"quest-declared","sealed":{"doneWhen":{"probe":"scenario-harness","args":{"scenario":"parallel-session-quest-leases","consecutive":3,"metric":"priority"}},"frontierMetrics":[{"probe":"scenario-harness","args":{"scenario":"parallel-session-quest-leases","metric":"priority"}}],"authoringContractVersion":1,"statement":"Each quest has at most one live claiming session across all worktrees: a second claimant is refused with the holder named, a lease dies with its worktree or a lapsed heartbeat rather than outliving its session, and no append-only quest log can be forked by two concurrent writers.","title":null,"class":"process","constraints":[{"id":"source-change-subagent-verification","statement":"If this Quest changes source code, spawn a subagent verifier before audit and git handoff, then record a Solver finding with evidence subagent:<id>."},{"id":"registry-in-common-dir","statement":"Session records live under the git common dir, never under gitignored solve/state (gitignored means per-worktree, invisible to the sessions it should coordinate)."},{"id":"worktree-liveness-not-pid","statement":"A session is live while its worktree exists AND its heartbeat is fresh; solver commands are short-lived processes, so pid liveness must not be a lease criterion."},{"id":"fail-closed-with-loud-escape","statement":"A live conflicting lease refuses the claim naming the holder worktree, branch, and heartbeat; LAGRANGE_SESSION_LEASE_BYPASS is the only escape and the refusal message names it."},{"id":"registry-trouble-never-blocks","statement":"Registry unavailability (unreadable dir, corrupt session file) degrades to a printed warning; only a LIVE conflicting lease blocks quest work — the registry is a coordination aid, not an integrity invariant."},{"id":"gc-on-read","statement":"Every registry read prunes sessions whose worktree vanished or whose heartbeat lapsed, so stranded tmp-worktree registrations cannot hold leases past a reboot."}],"verificationTemplates":["concurrency-serialization","recovery-replay"],"frontierIds":["parallel-session-quest-leases-main"]}}
